            "description": "Someone claiming to be an enrolled student but carrying no student ID, major or year. The request is well formed, so it is not a 400; it just describes a person who cannot exist, and Credential Service would have nothing to print on an ID card.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"{{session_id}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Nobody At All\",\n  \"email\": \"nobody@isa.utm.md\",\n  \"university_status\": \"faf_student\",\n  \"role\": \"student\",\n  \"courses\": []\n}",
